subtitle: Their internal contradictions have finally caught up with them.
view-if: chancellor = "Staal" and staal_time == 10 and gallax_dead
new-page: true
tags: event
max-visits: 1
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/hitler_dead.jpg";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}

= The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> Splinters!

Those who follow Gallax, even after death, constitute of the Hitlerite faction, who remain in control of the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span>. This group consists of people like Standerton and Gorrick.

Those who follow Garrick Crowde, and his line of governmental participation, form the <span style="color: #6A1E1E;">Commonwealth Social Union</span> (<span style="color: #6A1E1E;">**DSU**</span>). This group consists of people like Crowde and Frask. The former having come back from retirement.

Those who follow Isen Glade, and his belief that an anti-capitalist revolution should be led by the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span>, form the <span style="color: #142e20;">National People's Front</span> (<span style="color: #142e20;">**NVF**</span>). This group consists of people like Glade and Lewin Pleck.

- @nazi_2: Without funds and without support. 

@nazi_2
on-arrival: {!
Q.royalist_split = 1;
Q.dsu_exist = 1;
Q.dsu_leader = "Crowde";
Q.nvf_exist = 1;

Q.royalist_funds -= 3;

Q.dsu_r = Math.round(Q.royalist_r*0.3 * 10) / 10;
Q.nvf_r = Math.round(Q.royalist_r*0.15 * 10) / 10;
Q.royalist_gallax_r = Math.round((Q.royalist_r - Q.dsu_r - Q.nvf_r) * 10) / 10;
!}

These parties are doomed to eternal infighting and, eventually, irrelevance. However, the polarization caused by this, coupled with the potential for participationist <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> entering the government, may still have far-reaching consequences.

We must not get complacent.